== Trivia ==
* The Ascent is referred to as "backwards" in the sequence's rooms file.
* According to an [https://youtu.be/MWfRn5wUzbo?si=EUEYmDgTWOpveMIP&t=6930 interview with _Kilburn], the tainted enemies were designed with inspiration from eternal champion monsters in [[enboi:The Binding of Isaac: Eternal Edition|The Binding of Isaac: Eternal Edition]].
* {{e|Great Gideon}} can be seen in its boss room during the Ascent. However, since he was already defeated on the way down, he will be deactivated.
** Even if he was encountered in the {{s|Ashpit}} during the normal descent, he will still appear in the {{s|Mines}} during the Ascent.
** He can still be destroyed by using the {{p|Chaos Card}}, to reveal the unique 1x2 {{r|Crawl Space}}.
** If he was previously destroyed with the {{p|Chaos Card}} before the ascent, he will be missing during the ascent.
* What sounds like a reversed version of Genesis Retake Light can be heard playing during the Ascent, and as the ascent progresses, more instruments are added to it based on the floors Isaac ascends through.
** The {{s|Mausoleum}} adds a crunchy, electric bass line.
** The {{s|Depths}} adds occasional guitar riffs and a unique composition.
** The {{s|Mines}} adds a drum line and metal clanking sounds.
** The {{s|Caves}} adds a standard bass line.
** The {{s|Downpour}} adds a fuller guitar line with an echo effect.
** The {{s|Basement}} adds a full drum line.

